ware to select target environments to delete data and render systems inoperable."],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0040","technique":"T1485"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--dbfe6415-cd2c-55f2-9509-06b6668ef23a","120":"instance--79ca45e2-afd7-51fa-9574-5085c7de4c84","150":"instance--39171cfe-3bf6-5200-b6f5-e97e3b047db7","180":"instance--8cda146b-7259-56b2-b337-56038a1f52d3","210":"instance--a662f8bf-2723-58c0-a1a8-9af9497cf428","240":"instance--a9b75b15-3be0-5e64-8132-40b87e7ae405","270":"instance--31896ecd-322b-5a41-bd1e-0b7a30b9d9d1","30":"instance--60868276-2726-597d-8f57-8aa7fc9c0738","300":"instance--4f5668fa-b6ef-57cc-93da-5cd1e1727a22","330":"instance--b022a562-9020-587c-a5be-97d254cc8f11","60":"instance--cf452b0f-192e-5357-ba8c-fbae1a6e4ae0","90":"instance--012cc6fc-0a37-5e6e-b9b7-07f3bcd2d02c"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--17","properties":[["name","Leak stolen data on Free Civilian onion site"],["description","Also in January of 2022, Microsoft identified that data exfiltrated by Cadet Blizzard in compromises of various Ukrainian organizations was leaked on a Tor .onion site under the name \u201cFree Civilian.\u201d"],["confidence",0.0],["ttp",{"tactic":"TA0010","technique":"T1567.001"}]]},{"anchors":{"0":"instance--a73f63ad-1c10-59c2-82aa-bef4ae8f64e0","120":"instance--62757838-a58e-5d41-b7e3-1ccc64e8cdbf","150":"instance--3462202b-a91d-5325-abfe-876a63049484","180":"instance--72959cd4-5e05-5d69-a145-8b6f35720646","210":"instance--d3b85082-8de6-5ffd-8abe-c9e1ec43f533","240":"instance--0a22ffab-8bbc-55b1-85ec-df74e4a120f6","270":"instance--548b3ba1-955f-5e04-b6e8-064cc259e7a6","30":"instance--6f0a37c5-db81-5459-92c1-bc8ab8cd1fd3","300":"instance--e81be898-f7c2-56a0-a705-d2aba8831f75","330":"instance--8f207ed6-cb63-551c-9a40-583fac14fe80","60":"instance--8b44546f-f8e4-5d12-b172-99f9507395eb","90":"instance--f61db455-1665-504d-85b4-5fd5d40fbcc2"},"id":"action","instance":"attack-action--18","properties":[["name","Establish Free Civilian Tele